Follow `/workspace/AGENTS.md` for build commands, style, and architecture expectations.

## Product direction
- North star: `docs/project-visions/endgame.md` — competitive endgame chess in the browser
- Session focus: `.cursor/goals.md` and `docs/progress.md`
- Active execution plan: `docs/plans/endgame-phase-zero.md` (until Phase 0 completes)

## Architecture (non-negotiable)
- Domain logic in `src/domain/` — never in React components
- Endgame-specific: `src/domain/endgame/`, `src/features/endgame/`
- Reuse chessboard from `src/features/chessboard/` — do not fork board rendering
- Heatmap state via `heatmapSettingsContext.tsx`; register overlays in registry files
- Server owns game truth in multiplayer (Phase 1+); client sends move intents only

## Definition of done (feature work)
- `npm run lint` clean
- `npm run build` succeeds
- Storybook story for new interactive UI
- Update `docs/progress.md` and `.cursor/goals.md`
